# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-selec01-0 = 
    你已近$PlaceName的高大外垣。<br><p>
    你决定去 ...<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>从下水道爬出。<br><p><opt>...<indent>抛下马匹，自下水道爬出。<br><p><opt>...<indent>以$Money1贿赂守卫，使其放行。<br><p><opt>...<indent>夜深后潜攀城墙，再以绳索滑下。<br><p><opt>...<indent>夜深后弃马，潜攀城墙，再以绳索滑下。<br><p><opt>...<indent>夜深后潜越城墙，再攀下。<br><p><opt>...<indent>夜深后弃马，潜越城墙，再攀下。<br><p><opt>...<indent>另觅一门而出。<br><p><opt-saints>...<indent>呼唤圣人以求援助。<br><p><opt>...<indent>回归街头。<br>
msg-selec01-1 = 
    凭借你的巨大力量与灵巧身手，$ChosenOneName撬开下水道井盖，你们逃离城市，重获自由。
msg-selec01-2 = 
    After crawling through the dank sewers for hours, you come to a sewer grate. $ChosenOneName tries to pry it loose, but it is too tightly fitted. Even using tools, $he cannot open it. You must go back through the sewers the way you came, but now you are drenched in the foul liquid through which you crawled. Passers-by on the street hold their noses as you walk by.{" "}
msg-selec01-3 = 
    Greedily the guard eyes the bribe, then snatches it from your hand. Grinning, he unlocks the sally port and opens it. You leave the city for the cool fresh air outside.{" "}
msg-selec01-4 = 
    当卫兵伸手取钱，他细察你的面容。<br><p>
    “嗯，认得尔等，”他言，“捉尔之赏高于此！”忽而大呼，“警报！敌袭城垣！”<br><p>
    你环顾四周，见一队守卫正沿女墙奔来。
msg-selec01-5 = 
    You stealthily creep up to the wall, and climb it, taking advantage of every nook in the masonry to hide yourselves. When you reach the top, you quickly tie a rope around one of the crenellations and let yourselves down. Unfortunately, you have no way of getting the rope down after you, so you leave it hanging behind.{" "}
msg-selec01-6 = 
    You stealthily creep toward the wall, but an alert guard spots you. "Stop!" he shouts. But you have already vanished back into the slums of $PlaceName. When next you look at the wall, you see that the guards are now nervous and watchful, looking around for other attempts at illicit exit.{" "}
msg-selec01-7 = 
    悄悄攀至墙顶，未遇一人。众人安然自墙下而降，随即迈步踏入荒野。
msg-selec01-8 = 
    悄然攀至墙顶，未遇一人。众人沿墙而下，唯有一人失足跌落，所伤甚微。不久，你们便踏上了荒野之路。
msg-selec01-9 = 
    悄然攀至墙顶，未遇一人。不幸的是，队伍中有人在下攀时失足，受了轻伤。不久，你们便大步踏入荒野。
msg-selec01-10 = 
    Holding $his arms outstretched in prayer, $ChosenOneName intones words of praise and supplication to $NamedOneName. The saint answers, and you are each gripped by an invisible force which lifts you safely and swiftly over the city walls.{" "}
msg-selec01-11 = 
    Holding $his arms outstretched in prayer, $ChosenOneName intones words of praise and supplication to $NamedOneName. The saint does not answer, and you are forced to rethink your plan.{" "}
msg-selec01-12 = 
    因天色尚明，你待至夜深方伺机而动。
msg-selec01-13 = 
    Holding $his arms outstretched in prayer, $ChosenOneName intones words of praise and supplication to Saint Reinold. The saint answers, and you find yourselves able to skim your way up, clinging to the surface even in spots where the wall is blank stone.{" "}{" "}
